{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"391f689651ac77007740ec9cfcee8be31094f7b42d18306b83fba00a23e15c16","ja":"はぐらかす歩さん","zh":"闪烁其词的步","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"be3e9b14e3f91506a410598f7b7003640cd68232db2ed617ea4b27c12c0a84b8","ja":"お疲れ～。\nあれ？　みんな、集まってどうしたの？","zh":"辛苦啦～。\n咦？大家聚在一起是怎么了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8855f9dc3d15b387f397c87cb7d66ccdc02f2db32fb8ce8d911916939b1b1245","ja":"むにゃむにゃ……。","zh":"唔唔……唔嗯……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"cd826d5214a55c04f9bc9a835ade603c948202903e5d2f0bf27233d50be2ab12","ja":"あ～！　やっときたの！\n歩、最近コソコソしてるでしょ？","zh":"啊～！你终于来了！\n步最近总是在鬼鬼祟祟的吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"9c1b5ed1eb3230ce06b427ab59c95502bd5af39432c238ce346af2ba01ea0fec","ja":"なに企んでるの？　ミキ、気になりすぎて、\nうまく眠れないかもって思うな。","zh":"在打什么鬼主意呢？美希好奇得不行，\n都感觉要睡不好觉了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"c4b84b6f6c1ed713b58bda066af30e7d5b1707ca440fff33d05e2c052fa3ecb9","ja":"い、いや、美希、\n今、ウトウトしてたよね……？","zh":"没、没有，美希，\n你刚刚打瞌睡了吧……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"bf7f15d4a8d06c65d17a50d14b9ea62f0d0071f9c20e048881c4ce127a30a0c8","ja":"あのね、歩さん。わたしたち、心配してるんだよ。\n何かあったんじゃないかって。","zh":"那个啊，步小姐。我们很担心你哦。\n心想着你是不是遇到了什么事。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"7f6a2ba61f1a6c2b6c8a7f6f447429d8638463e6fef70ec456808f8abc252dd4","ja":"そうですよ。\nずっと気にしてたんですから！","zh":"就是说啊。\n我可是一直都很在意的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"d7f5055face552a61332e6c78bf7aabea6580f5230b1db48c0cadec6f5f0a2c4","ja":"あんなにいい香りのするうどん屋さんを目の前にして、\nどこかに行ってしまうだなんて……！","zh":"明明那么香的乌冬面店就在眼前，\n竟然还要去别的地方……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"dc63958297a59e856e1bbc3679c5d1120054c7e3cd94551b9245bde840a7036d","ja":"わ、私も……歩さんが……アロマに興味が出てきたなら\n……お、お話しできたら……う、うれしいなって……。","zh":"我、我也……要是步小姐对……芳香疗法产生兴趣的话\n……要、要是能聊一聊……我、我会很开心的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"21a8877ea1631aa470039389485a39a9718e3d3925da15d94b94319e12434ce4","ja":"えーと……アロマって、\nな、なんのことかな～……って……。","zh":"那个……香薰是、\n指什么来着～……话说……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"153bf9497b69f6bc42f112ad8ea615f422714284c0d4d74f0892b8ac038ae5fd","ja":"えっ……？　あ、あの……3日前、アロマのお店に……\nい、いましたよね……？","zh":"咦……？那个……3天前，你在香薰店里……\n对、对吧……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"c04ab994401c784e7816a56d4c2f0b45cadc12d0e032176ea834dca080d7752d","ja":"……い、行ってないよ？\n人違い……じゃないかな！？","zh":"……没、没去过哦？\n是不是……认错人了啊！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"972bdd593c19925fdf48ea29e07436e22803fccb7a135cb2624ccc143c1ebb12","ja":"えっ……そ、そうだったんですか……？","zh":"诶……是、是这样吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"d986ce79478af923b2ccfba2b849e891619b566350fc36482bd072b1935261d9","ja":"だまされちゃダメ！　歩のピンクの髪と\nカラフルなファッションを、間違えるわけないの！","zh":"可不能被骗了！我怎么可能会认错\n步那一头粉发和一身色彩斑斓的穿着呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"9e012b74ed994d8da85d40928d5efab08cf458cb87a5fe037053fa936f078e5d","ja":"歩、この前、ミキの好きな\nコスメ売り場のところにも、いたよね？","zh":"步，之前美希喜欢的\n化妆品专柜那里，你也在对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"6e466d1eb224d82299f327fd039a2a1388bb355a47ce70517e620bd2a983c22e","ja":"……そ、そうだった？　全然覚えてなくて……。\nあ……もしかして。","zh":"……是、是这样吗？我完全不记得了……\n啊……难道说。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"8f8e509d2fa89c00500e01b017cc28769a2841edab1a5fa8a30a79d09c9fa570","ja":"アタシの別人格かも！","zh":"说不定是我的另一个人格！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"aef5fd83a509f63199aa4e999c2e8ddf5afb1ede834f471e7a3a20bd571dadda","ja":"え、えええっ！？","zh":"诶，诶诶诶！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1066.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"3f493a76bc5736d6097bc53acfdd6b1459a7915797e697ad35c2fe9f69d0113e","ja":"そんな！？\n歩さんだけど、歩さんじゃなかったってこと！？","zh":"怎么会！？\n意思是虽然是步小姐，但其实不是步小姐吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
